⦿ Xor (Male) - Poisi - Minor Protag-Supporting - Xor, born in Tilox, was a nationalist in his youth. He believed the Poisi Elementals were superior to everyone with no compromise,
and was even a founder in their Knightsdale Movement. He was arrested shortly after, so had little influence in the later years when the Siege of Set put them into power. He was given
a seat in the government, but his loyalty wavered slightly when the state killed his daughter due to her protesting. Knowing this would have this effect, the state had already planned
to replace him, sending him away. He flees to Earth, fearing for his life, where he begins to justify his nationalistic tendencies while integrating with humanity. He eventually helps
Adva, Ember, and Kael integrate into human society, but is killed by Ember when she discovers his nationalist ties.
Birthday: Year 844, Month Venos, Day 7
